                    </div> <a href="https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence" rel="external" class="underline-link">Licence Ouverte / Open Licence version 2.0</a></div></div></div></div> <!----> <div class="py-0 col-md-12 col-12"><div tabindex="-1" class="v-list-item theme--light"><div class="v-list-item__content"><div class="v-list-item__title" style="white-space:normal;"><div class="v-subheader pa-0 theme--light" style="height:26px;">
